{"pid": "p00", "phenomenon": "inversion_dialogue", "archaic": {"text": "Said she, when the door was shut, that she would go.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 0, "subj_head": "she,"}, "modern": {"text": "She said, when the door was shut, that she would go.", "subj_tok": 0, "verb_tok": 1, "subj_head": "She"}}
{"pid": "p01", "phenomenon": "inversion_dialogue", "archaic": {"text": "\"I resolved not to disturb you,\" replied he to the anxious host.", "subj_tok": 7, "verb_tok": 6, "subj_head": "he"}, "modern": {"text": "\"I resolved not to disturb you,\" he replied to the anxious host.", "subj_tok": 6, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "he"}}
{"pid": "p02", "phenomenon": "inversion_dialogue", "archaic": {"text": "\"Nonsense,\" cried the old man, and he struck the table.", "subj_tok": 4, "verb_tok": 1, "subj_head": "man,"}, "modern": {"text": "\"Nonsense,\" the old man cried, and he struck the table.", "subj_tok": 3, "verb_tok": 4, "subj_head": "man"}}
{"pid": "p03", "phenomenon": "inversion_locative", "archaic": {"text": "So was the black horned thing seated aloof upon a rock.", "subj_tok": 5, "verb_tok": 6, "subj_head": "thing"}, "modern": {"text": "The black horned thing was seated aloof upon a rock.", "subj_tok": 3, "verb_tok": 5, "subj_head": "thing"}}
{"pid": "p04", "phenomenon": "inversion_locative", "archaic": {"text": "Down came the heavy rain upon the ruined tower.", "subj_tok": 4, "verb_tok": 1, "subj_head": "rain"}, "modern": {"text": "The heavy rain came down upon the ruined tower.", "subj_tok": 2, "verb_tok": 3, "subj_head": "rain"}}
{"pid": "p05", "phenomenon": "heavy_presubject", "archaic": {"text": "Thirteen winters' revolving frosts had seen her open the ball.", "subj_tok": 3, "verb_tok": 5, "subj_head": "frosts"}, "modern": {"text": "The frosts of thirteen revolving winters had seen her open the ball.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "frosts"}}
{"pid": "p06", "phenomenon": "heavy_presubject", "archaic": {"text": "The whole seizure, progress, and termination of the disease were brief.", "subj_tok": 2, "verb_tok": 9, "subj_head": "seizure,"}, "modern": {"text": "The seizure, the progress, and the end of the disease were all brief.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 10, "subj_head": "seizure,"}}
{"pid": "p07", "phenomenon": "heavy_presubject", "archaic": {"text": "The astonishment of the ladies at the news was exactly what he wished.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "astonishment"}, "modern": {"text": "The ladies' astonishment at the news was exactly what he wished.", "subj_tok": 2, "verb_tok": 6, "subj_head": "astonishment"}}
{"pid": "p08", "phenomenon": "archaic_morph_hath", "archaic": {"text": "For it hath a rounded and orbicular sound, and rings like bullion.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 2, "subj_head": "it"}, "modern": {"text": "Because it has a rounded and orbicular sound, and rings like bullion.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 2, "subj_head": "it"}}
{"pid": "p09", "phenomenon": "archaic_morph_ere", "archaic": {"text": "Ere the sun had set, the weary knight departed from the hall.", "subj_tok": 7, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "knight"}, "modern": {"text": "Before the sun had set, the weary knight departed from the hall.", "subj_tok": 7, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "knight"}}
{"pid": "p10", "phenomenon": "archaic_morph_thou", "archaic": {"text": "Thou knowest well what a file is, and where it lies.", "subj_tok": 0, "verb_tok": 1, "subj_head": "Thou"}, "modern": {"text": "You know well what a file is, and where it lies.", "subj_tok": 0, "verb_tok": 1, "subj_head": "You"}}
{"pid": "p11", "phenomenon": "archaic_morph_whilst", "archaic": {"text": "Whilst the master slept, the two clerks copied the long document.", "subj_tok": 6, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "clerks"}, "modern": {"text": "While the master slept, the two clerks copied the long document.", "subj_tok": 6, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "clerks"}}
{"pid": "p12", "phenomenon": "fronted_participial", "archaic": {"text": "Observing his daughter at her work, the father addressed her kindly.", "subj_tok": 7, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "father"}, "modern": {"text": "The father, observing his daughter at her work, addressed her kindly.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "father,"}}
{"pid": "p13", "phenomenon": "fronted_adjunct", "archaic": {"text": "At the period just preceding the advent of the stranger, I had two clerks then.", "subj_tok": 10, "verb_tok": 11, "subj_head": "I"}, "modern": {"text": "I had two clerks at the period just before the stranger arrived.", "subj_tok": 0, "verb_tok": 1, "subj_head": "I"}}
{"pid": "p14", "phenomenon": "long_subj_verb_gap", "archaic": {"text": "The receiver in the great cause has acquired a goodly sum of money.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "receiver"}, "modern": {"text": "The receiver in the great lawsuit has acquired a good sum of money.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "receiver"}}
{"pid": "p15", "phenomenon": "long_subj_verb_gap", "archaic": {"text": "Her father, a proud and idle man, had held a government position for years.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "father,"}, "modern": {"text": "Her father, a proud and idle man, held a government position for years.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 7, "subj_head": "father,"}}
{"pid": "p16", "phenomenon": "subjunctive_inversion", "archaic": {"text": "Were the danger known, they would rank it among their misfortunes.", "subj_tok": 2, "verb_tok": 0, "subj_head": "danger"}, "modern": {"text": "If the danger were known, they would rank it among their misfortunes.", "subj_tok": 2, "verb_tok": 3, "subj_head": "danger"}}
{"pid": "p17", "phenomenon": "quoth", "archaic": {"text": "Quoth the raven to the frightened scholar, nevermore shall he rest.", "subj_tok": 2, "verb_tok": 0, "subj_head": "raven"}, "modern": {"text": "The raven said to the frightened scholar that he would never rest.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 2, "subj_head": "raven"}}
{"pid": "p18", "phenomenon": "archaic_negation", "archaic": {"text": "The master affirmed that he cared not for the crowd's opinion.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 2, "subj_head": "master"}, "modern": {"text": "The master affirmed that he did not care for the crowd's opinion.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 2, "subj_head": "master"}}
{"pid": "p19", "phenomenon": "heavy_coordinate_subj", "archaic": {"text": "The redness and the horror of the plague were its avatar and its seal.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "redness"}, "modern": {"text": "The redness and the horror of the plague were its symbol and its mark.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "redness"}}
{"pid": "p20", "phenomenon": "archaic_relative", "archaic": {"text": "The wall, black by age and everlasting shade, required no spy-glass.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "wall,"}, "modern": {"text": "The wall, blackened by age and endless shade, required no telescope.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 8, "subj_head": "wall,"}}
{"pid": "p21", "phenomenon": "object_fronting", "archaic": {"text": "Full many a gem the dark unfathomed caves of ocean bear.", "subj_tok": 7, "verb_tok": 10, "subj_head": "caves"}, "modern": {"text": "The dark unfathomed caves of ocean bear full many a gem.", "subj_tok": 3, "verb_tok": 6, "subj_head": "caves"}}
{"pid": "p22", "phenomenon": "archaic_aux_drop", "archaic": {"text": "The knight, being wounded, spake not, but turned his horse away.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 4, "subj_head": "knight,"}, "modern": {"text": "The knight, being wounded, did not speak, but turned his horse away.", "subj_tok": 1, "verb_tok": 6, "subj_head": "knight,"}}
